+ * k may be larger than the length, and wraps around. The input is not changed.
+ * @param {Array} xs
+ * @param {number} k A whole number.
+ * @returns {Array} A new array. For example rotate([1, 2, 3, 4], 1) gives [2, 3, 4, 1], and rotate([1, 2, 3, 4], -1) gives [4, 1, 2, 3].
+ * @throws {TypeError} If xs is not an array, or k is not a number.
+ * @throws {RangeError} If k is not a whole number.
+ */
